        text: As it is the path <pause=0.2>of Mortal.
        questToStart: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e4fe6399c04766640b61281c437e2bf2, type: 2}
        nextNodeID: 
    - rid: 6341597701008523264
      type: {class: DialogueLineNode, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        nodeID: Start
        text: Oh, <pause=0.5><shake>another</shake> Mortal has washed ashore.
        nextNodeID: What do you remember
    - rid: 6341597701008523266
      type: {class: ChoiceNode, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        nodeID: What do you remember
        text: What is the last thing you remember, young one. Before here and now.
          <pause=0.2> Before you opened your eyes?
        choices:
        - choiceText: I ... I was on high sea
          nextNodeID: On High Sea
        - choiceText: It's all fuzzy right now
          nextNodeID: It's all fuzzy
    - rid: 6341597701008523267
      type: {class: DialogueLineNode, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        nodeID: On High Sea
        text: 'Ah. <pause=0.2>We are getting a step closer. <pause=0.2>

          Then
          this should remind you of something.'
        nextNodeID: Do you know what this means
    - rid: 6341597701008523268
      type: {class: DialogueLineNode, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        nodeID: It's all fuzzy
        text: 'Let me remind you. You were on the sea, looking for the truth, <pause=0.2>looking
          for the proof.

          Maybe this will help you remember.'
        nextNodeID: Do you know what this means
    - rid: 6341597701008523269
      type: {class: ChoiceNode, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        nodeID: Do you know what this means
        text: Now. <pause=0.5>The world, <pause=0.2>as you have known, has moved
          on. But the stars <pause=0.2>see everything <pause=0.2>and they have settled.
          Do you know what this means?
        choices:
        - choiceText: What is this nonsense?
          nextNodeID: Thesis Handed
        - choiceText: I am not in "my" world?
          nextNodeID: Thesis Handed
